{"id":"3f6d8efae0e395b8","group":"62","path":"62/62-df-Cantor-compactness.md","title":"Coded Compactness Principles for Cantor Space","display":"df-Cantor-compactness — Coded Compactness Principles for Cantor Space","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)","book_abbrev":"62","label":"62-df-Cantor-compactness","aliases":["62-df-Cantor-compactness"],"display":"df-Cantor-compactness — Coded Compactness Principles for Cantor Space","depends_on":["[[62-df-Tree]]","[[62-df-finite-sequence]]","[[62-df-coded-function]]"],"source":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), §IV.1 (Cantor space compactness formulation)","source_pages":[127,128,129,130],"source_pdf_pages":[145,146,147,148]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"62"},{"key":"label","html":"62-df-Cantor-compactness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>62-df-Cantor-compactness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-Cantor-compactness — Coded Compactness Principles for Cantor Space"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bb825000fd9a8272\" href=\"?note=bb825000fd9a8272\" title=\"62-df-Tree\">62-df-Tree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b7164631e6f56192\" href=\"?note=b7164631e6f56192\" title=\"62-df-finite-sequence\">62-df-finite-sequence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c156c03daff0aff0\" href=\"?note=c156c03daff0aff0\" title=\"62-df-coded-function\">62-df-coded-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), §IV.1 (Cantor space compactness formulation)"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>127</span><span>128</span><span>129</span><span>130</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>145</span><span>146</span><span>147</span><span>148</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>树、路径见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"bb825000fd9a8272\" href=\"?note=bb825000fd9a8272\" title=\"62-df-Tree\">62-df-Tree</a>，有限二进制序列见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b7164631e6f56192\" href=\"?note=b7164631e6f56192\" title=\"62-df-finite-sequence\">62-df-finite-sequence</a>，函数图与截面见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c156c03daff0aff0\" href=\"?note=c156c03daff0aff0\" title=\"62-df-coded-function\">62-df-coded-function</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{BinFun}(f)\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf{Fun}(f,N,\\{0,1\\})\">\\(\\mathsf{BinFun}(f)\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf{Fun}(f,N,\\{0,1\\})\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CC}_{\\mathrm{open}}\">\\(\\mathrm{CC}_{\\mathrm{open}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CC}_{\\mathrm{FIP}}\">\\(\\mathrm{CC}_{\\mathrm{FIP}}\\)</span> 是下列句子。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}Cantor\\text{-}compactness}\\vdash\\;\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CC}_{\\mathrm{open}}\\coloneqq\\forall U\\bigl[&amp;(U\\subseteq2^{&lt;N}\\land\\forall f(\\mathsf{BinFun}(f)\\to\\exists n\\;f[n]\\in U))\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\exists b\\forall f(\\mathsf{BinFun}(f)\\to\\exists n(f[n]\\in U\\land f[n]&lt;b))\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}Cantor\\text{-}compactness}\\vdash\\;\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CC}_{\\mathrm{open}}\\coloneqq\\forall U\\bigl[&amp;(U\\subseteq2^{&lt;N}\\land\\forall f(\\mathsf{BinFun}(f)\\to\\exists n\\;f[n]\\in U))\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\exists b\\forall f(\\mathsf{BinFun}(f)\\to\\exists n(f[n]\\in U\\land f[n]&lt;b))\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CC}_{\\mathrm{FIP}}\\coloneqq\\forall C\\bigl[&amp;\\forall i\\;\\operatorname{BinTree}((C)_i)\\land\n\\forall k\\exists f(\\mathsf{BinFun}(f)\\land\\forall i\\le k\\;\\mathsf{Path}((C)_i,f))\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\exists f(\\mathsf{BinFun}(f)\\land\\forall i\\;\\mathsf{Path}((C)_i,f))\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CC}_{\\mathrm{FIP}}\\coloneqq\\forall C\\bigl[&amp;\\forall i\\;\\operatorname{BinTree}((C)_i)\\land\n\\forall k\\exists f(\\mathsf{BinFun}(f)\\land\\forall i\\le k\\;\\mathsf{Path}((C)_i,f))\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\exists f(\\mathsf{BinFun}(f)\\land\\forall i\\;\\mathsf{Path}((C)_i,f))\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>U 的每个结点编码一个基本柱开集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f[n]&lt;b\">\\(f[n]&lt;b\\)</span> 限制数码，所以给出有限多个柱集。C 编码一列闭集的树，不是任意第三阶闭集族。FIP 使用“每个有限初始段有公共路径”，与任意有限子族有交相同。这里为 IV.1 的 Cantor 空间紧致性补出明确编码版本；与 WKL 的关系由本目录的紧致性定理给出构造证明，不把此显示式冒称原书逐字定义。</p>\n<p>来源：第二版（2009），§IV.1 (Cantor space compactness formulation)；纸面页 127, 128, 129, 130；PDF 页 145, 146, 147, 148。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"62-df-Tree","status":"resolved","id":"bb825000fd9a8272","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-Tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-finite-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"b7164631e6f56192","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-finite-sequence]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-coded-function","status":"resolved","id":"c156c03daff0aff0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","