inFun}(f)\\land\\forall i\\le k\\;\\mathsf{Path}((C)_i,f))\\\\\n&\\to\\exists f(\\mathsf{BinFun}(f)\\land\\forall i\\;\\mathsf{Path}((C)_i,f))\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"f[n]<b","display":false}],"bytes":2127,"backlinks":[{"id":"c68a6ecbed6addff","anchor":"ref-61","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[62-df-Cantor-compactness|Coded Compactness Principles for Cantor Space]]"},{"id":"12dd1abd58868c22","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"理论见 [[62-df-RCA0]]、[[62-df-WKL0]]；$\\mathrm{CC}_{\\mathrm{open}}$、$\\mathrm{CC}_{\\mathrm{FIP}}$ 的树编码版本见 [[62-df-Cantor-compactness]]，$\\operatorname{EquivOver}_{S_2}$ 见 [[62-df-equivalence-over-base]]。"}],"outgoing":["bb825000fd9a8272","b7164631e6f56192","c156c03daff0aff0"]}